\ The earlier program: Phase 4 slice 6a's dogfood (`examples/array_totals.sth`)
\ rewrites this hand-threaded array walk over `each`/`map`/`fold` from
\ `lib/combinators.sth`. Three manual `times` loops over the same array, each
\ with a synthesized `>usize` index, a `&arr i &> @` read and (for the
\ doubling loop) a `&!arr i &!> v !` write.

: scores ( -- [i64 5] )
  0 5 fill | s |
  &!s 0 >usize &!> 3 !
  &!s 1 >usize &!> 7 !
  &!s 2 >usize &!> 1 !
  &!s 3 >usize &!> 9 !
  &!s 4 >usize &!> 5 !
  s ;

: main ( -- )
  scores | arr |
  0 5 [ | i | &arr i >usize &> @ + ] times .
  5 [ | i | &arr i >usize &> @ 2 * | v | &!arr i >usize &!> v ! ] times
  5 [ | i | &arr i >usize &> @ . ] times
  arr drop ;
